{"id": "46", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, how to fold a quilt: 1 Step 1: Lay your quilt on a bed, table or other flat surface. 2 Step 2: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 3 Step 3: Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 4 Step 4: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 5 Step 5: Making sure the fold is on the bias, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, how to fold a quilt: 1 Step 1: Lay your quilt on a bed, table or other flat surface. 2 Step 2: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 3 Step 3: Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 4 Step 4: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 5 Step 5: Making sure the fold is on the bias, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.", "time_sec": 11.644, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 2606, 1317, 16584, 1261, 1442, 4867, 1058, 1032, 1049, 25181, 1032, 1049, 1058, 57340, 2143, 1442, 4867, 1408, 1261, 7153, 1044, 4234, 1505, 2147, 14038, 4691, 1046, 1032, 1050, 25181, 1032, 1050, 1058, 1439, 2189, 1278, 4953, 3169, 15552, 2015, 8741, 1278, 7034, 1307, 1278, 1442, 4867, 6187, 5257, 1278, 16584, 1395, 1408, 1278, 17678, 1046, 1032, 1051, 25181, 1032, 1051, 1058, 1439, 2189, 1278, 4953, 3979, 155