{"id": "48", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, also on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n\nThese steps will result in a neatly folded quilt with four even corners. Note that the size of the quilt is not specified in the passages, so these steps can be applied to quilts of any size.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, how to fold a quilt: 1 Step 1: Lay your quilt on a bed, table or other flat surface. 2 Step 2: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 3 Step 3: Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 4 Step 4: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 5 Step 5: Making sure the fold is on the bias, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, how to fold a quilt: 1 Step 1: Lay your quilt on a bed, table or other flat surface. 2 Step 2: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 3 Step 3: Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 4 Step 4: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias. 5 Step 5: Making sure the fold is on the bias, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.", "time_sec": 11.489, "nemotron": {"runtime": "tran