{"id": "50", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick, also known as a Waterpik, is a beneficial tool for oral care. It is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It can also help maintain overall body health. In comparison to flossing, using a water pick can be easier and leave your mouth feeling cleaner. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. It is especially useful in cleaning around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot reach.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, benefits of a water pick include: it helps keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque tough to remove with a toothbrush; it massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis; and it cleans better around teeth and gums, removing food from areas brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, benefits of a water pick include: it helps keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque tough to remove with a toothbrush; it massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis; and it cleans better around teeth and gums, removing food from areas brushing cannot access.", "time_sec": 7.536, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 15021, 1307, 1261, 4180, 8427, 4626, 1058, 1494, 16348, 5807, 20277, 1044, 1343, 11558, 1044, 11504, 1044, 1321, 9698, 4212, 11716