{"id": "54", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n* Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.\n* Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n* Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.\n\nTherefore, using a water pick can be an effective addition to your oral hygiene routine, complementing traditional brushing and flossing methods.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, benefits of a water pick include: it helps keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque tough to remove with a toothbrush; it massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis; and it cleans better around teeth and gums, removing food from areas brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, benefits of a water pick include: it helps keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque tough to remove with a toothbrush; it massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis; and it cleans better around teeth and gums, removing food from areas brushing cannot access.", "time_sec": 7.273, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 15021, 1307, 1261, 4180, 8427, 4626, 1058, 1494, 16348, 5807, 20277, 1044, 1343, 11558, 1044, 11504, 1044, 1321, 9698, 4212, 117163, 1536, 2