{"id": "74", "question": "how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some signs that a male coworker may be flirting with you:\n\n* He finds reasons to be near you and seek you out discreetly (Passage 3)\n* He is always staring at you and catches your eye (Passage 2)\n* He touches you unnecessarily or finds excuses to have physical contact with you (Passage 2)\n* He smiles at you excessively or without apparent reason (Passage 2)\n* He seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him (Passage 1)\n\nIf you observe these behaviors from a male coworker, it may be a sign that he is interested in you and flirting with you. However, it's essential to remember that these signs alone do not necessarily mean the person likes you romantically, and it's possible they just have a friendly interest in you. To confirm their intentions, consider observing their behavior over time, and if you feel comfortable, try initiating a conversation or asking them out.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you: 1 If he constantly finds reasons to touch you, as this is described as a sign he likes you since someone who doesn't like you probably wouldn't do this as it is \"a little obnoxious\" 2 If he seems uncomfortable or suggests you not continue flirting with him, as you should avoid this to prevent risking your job, especially when he's not interested 3 If he stares at you frequently, as this is noted as a sign someone likes you 4 If he finds any reason to be near you or is constantly at your desk seeking you out discreetly, as this is described as a guarantee that the person likes you 5 If he smiles at you without a good reason, as this is identified as one of the signs a co-worker is flirting with you", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, 