{"id": "129", "question": "building a lean-to shed", "gt": "What are the dimensions of the shed in passage 3?\n\nThe dimensions of the shed in passage 3 are 6 feet long by 4 feet wide.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, building a lean-to shed involves: 1. Preparing the site with a 4″ layer of compacted gravel and cutting two 4 x 4 skids to 70 2/4″, then setting and leveling them. 2. Cutting two 2 x 6 rim joists to 7 3/4″ and six joists to 44 3/4″, assembling the floor, setting it on the skids, checking for square, and anchoring the frame to the skids with four joist clip angles. 3. Alternatively, cutting two pressure-treated 4 by 4s to 6 feet for skids, positioning the frame on the skids, toenailing floor joists to the skids when square, attaching 3/4-inch tongue-and-groove plywood flooring, and constructing walls separately before raising them onto the frame. 4. The shed dimensions are 6 feet long by 4 feet wide, with the ability to expand in increments of 2 or 4 feet, and floor framing requires cutting two pressure-treated 2 by 4s to 6 feet for rim joists.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, building a lean-to shed involves: 1. Preparing the site with a 4″ layer of compacted gravel and cutting two 4 x 4 skids to 70 2/4″, then setting and leveling them. 2. Cutting two 2 x 6 rim joists to 7 3/4″ and six joists to 44 3/4″, assembling the floor, setting it on the skids, checking for square, and anchoring the frame to the skids with four joist clip angles. 3. Alternatively, cutting two pressure-treated 4 by 4s to 6 feet for skids, positioning the frame on the skids, toenailing floor joists to the skids when square, attaching 3/4-inch tongue-and-groove plywood flooring, and constructing walls separately before raising them onto the frame. 4. The shed dimensions are 6 feet long by 4 feet wide, with the ability to expand in increments of 2 or 4 feet, and floor framing requires cutting two pressure-treated 2 by 4s to 6 feet for rim joists.", "time_sec": 21.867, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 7654, 1261, 16987, 6793, 42878, 19263, 1058, 1032, 1049, 1046, 90327, 1302, 1278, 5586, 1454, 1261, 1032, 1052, 12000, 6240, 1307, 23070, 1286, 59396, 1321, 23589, 2295, 1032, 1052, 2460, 1032, 1052, 3044, 4807, 1317, 1032, 1055, 1048, 1032, 1050, 1047, 1052, 12000, 1044, 2430, 9436, 1321, 3178, 1302, 2424, 1046, 1032, 1050, 1046, 42698, 3333, 2295, 1032, 1050, 2460, 1032, 1054, 17211, 5552, 3742, 1317, 1032, 1055, 1032, 1051, 1047, 1052, 12000, 1321, 5946, 5552, 3742, 1317, 1032, 1052, 1052, 1032, 1051, 1047, 1052, 12000, 1044, 112443, 1278, 11237, 1044, 9436, 1494, 1408, 1278, 3044, 4807, 1044, 24124, 1394, 12333, 1044, 1321, 126838, 1278, 6448, 1317, 1278, 3044, 4807, 1454, 3946, 5552, 1416, 29446, 28472, 1046, 1032, 1051, 1046, 37346, 1044, 23589, 2295, 6909, 30702, 1032, 1052, 1536, 1032, 1052, 1115, 1317, 1032, 1054, 10509, 1394, 3044, 4807, 1044, 36989, 1278, 6448, 1408, 1278, 3044, 4807, 1044, 46819, 42380, 11237, 5552, 3742, 1317, 1278, 3044, 4807, 2200, 12333, 1044, 85639, 1032, 1051, 1047, 1052, 44830, 25121, 15463, 5243, 1291, 2235, 77468, 10288, 18645, 8045, 1044, 1321, 58311, 16363, 25729, 3066, 33370, 2424, 10529, 1278, 6448, 1046, 1032, 1052, 1046, 1531, 42878, 18128, 1584, 1032, 1054, 10509, 2730, 1536, 1032, 1052, 10509, 9924, 1044, 1454, 1278, 8727, 1317, 10959, 1294, 91094, 1307, 1032, 1050, 1505, 1032, 1052, 10509, 1044, 1321, 11237, 91868, 10867, 23589, 2295, 6909, 30702, 1032, 1050, 1536, 1032, 1052, 1115, 1317, 1032, 1054, 10509, 1394, 17211, 5552, 3742, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0014, -0.0282, -0.0009, -0.0001, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0194, -1.1985, -0.1785, -0.003