{"id": "181", "question": "psychological effects of hugging", "gt": "Hugging has physiological benefits and can have a similar effect on the body as certain drugs. It can also lead to emotional intimacy and happy relationships. Hugging and touch, even with inanimate objects, can help reduce existential fears and worry about mortality.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, psychological effects of hugging include: it can lead to good relationships, emotional intimacy, and happy marriages through the use of empathy and listening skills (passage 2); it can make a conversation partner feel like they are receiving a hug, described as a psychological hug (passage 2); and it significantly reduces worry of mortality related to existential fears, even when hugging an inanimate object like a teddy bear (passage 3).", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, psychological effects of hugging include: it can lead to good relationships, emotional intimacy, and happy marriages through the use of empathy and listening skills (passage 2); it can make a conversation partner feel like they are receiving a hug, described as a psychological hug (passage 2); and it significantly reduces worry of mortality related to existential fears, even when hugging an inanimate object like a teddy bear (passage 3).", "time_sec": 9.176, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 23690, 5598, 1307, 39638, 7366, 4626, 1058, 1494, 1710, 3820, 1317, 3683, 14608, 1044, 20120, 104720, 1044, 1321, 15015, 80183, 2645, 1278, 2210, 1307, 84329, 1321, 27575, 14627, 1319, 12107, 1541, 1032, 1050, 3455, 1494, 1710, 3180, 1261, 18106, 16025, 5389, 2479, 2127, 1584, 12946, 1261, 39638, 1044, 5055, 1435, 1261, 23690, 39