{"id": "194", "question": "how to attach multiple picture frames together", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to attach multiple picture frames together:\n\n1. Select two or three frames of the same wood molding (Passage 1).\n2. Lay the frames beside each other to see if you like the effect (Passage 1).\n3. Mark the hinge placement on the connecting sides of the frames, making sure the placement is the same distance from the bottom edges of each frame (Passage 1).\n4. Attach two small hinges to the connecting sides of the frames (Passage 1).\n5. Test ideas by laying the group of multiple pictures out on the floor first (Passage 2).\n6. Screw the frame to the backer board, repeat with each frame, and attach a hanging wire to the back (Passage 3).\n\nIt's important to note that the passages do not provide specific information on how to attach multiple frames together other than the steps mentioned above. Therefore, if more detailed instructions are needed, it may be best to consult additional resources or seek advice from a professional framer.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to attach multiple picture frames together: First, select two or three frames of the same wood molding. For joining two together, use identical frames. For joining three together, choose either three of the same or one which is larger to be the middle frame. Lay them beside each other to see if you like the effect. Put two frames together back to back, and mark the hinge placement. The placement must be the same distance from the bottom edges of each frame to ensure that the grouped pictures stand securely on the table top. Attach two small hinges to the connecting sides of the frames.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to attach multiple picture frames together: First, select two or three frames of the same wood molding. For joining two together, use identical frames. For joining three together, choose either three of the same or one which is larger to be the middle frame. Lay them beside each other to see if you like the effect. Put two frames together back to back, and mark the hinge placement. The placement must be the same distance from the bottom edges of each frame to ensure that the grouped pictures stand securely on the table top. Attach two small hinges to the connecting sides of the frames.", "time_sec": 11.025, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 14722, 6245, 13083, 24751, 5823, 1058, 7610, 1044, 5762, 2295, 1505, 3300, 24751, 1307, 1278, 2879, 12603, 75224, 1046, 2898, 31427, 2295, 5823, 1044, 2210, 18535, 24751, 1046, 2898, 31427, 3300, 5823, 1044, 12729, 5250, 3300, 1307, 1278, 2879, 1505, 1925, 1799, 1395, 9039, 1317, 1402, 1278, 9949, 6448, 1046, 57340, 2424, 25644, 2744, 2147, 1317, 3219, 1693, 1636, 2479, 1278, 2851, 1046, 21374, 2295, 24751, 5823, 2595, 1317, 2595, 1044, 1321, 3780, 1278, 72443, 30880, 1046, 1531, 30880, 4016, 1402, 1278, 2879, 7786, 1562, 1278, 9478, 20978, 1307, 2744, 6448, 1317, 11811, 1455, 1278, 43404, 23874, 3679, 98053, 1408, 1278, 4234, 3977, 1046, 10436, 1664, 2295, 3709, 26268, 1264, 1317, 1278, 22460, 15819, 1307, 1278, 24751, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.002, -0.5673, -0.0001, -0.019, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.181, -0.967, -0.0177, -0.0833, -0.0357, -0.0025, -0.0025, -0.1324, -0.0081, -0.0086, -0.0, -0.0016, -0.0, -0.5393, -0.0452, -0.0008, -0.0001, -0.578, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0006, -0.0, -0.1861, -0.04, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0041, -0.0, -0.0037, -0.0125, -0.0001, -0.021, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2409, -0.0001, -0.2288, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0198, -0.0629, -0.0076, -0.0014, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0725, -0.0