{"id": "195", "question": "how to attach multiple picture frames together", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a brief answer to the question:\n\nTo attach multiple picture frames together, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. Select two or three frames of the same wood molding.\n2. Lay them beside each other to see if you like the effect.\n3. Put two frames together back to back, and mark the hinge placement. The placement must be the same distance from the bottom edges of each frame to ensure that the grouped pictures stand securely on the table top.\n4. Attach two small hinges to the connecting sides of the frames.\n5. Repeat the process for additional frames, ensuring that the hinge placement is consistent across all frames.\n6. Attach a hanging wire to the back of the grouped frames and hang them up.\n\nTherefore, the answer is: Select frames with the same wood molding, lay them together, mark hinge placement, attach hinges, and attach a hanging wire to the back.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to attach multiple picture frames together: First, select two or three frames of the same wood molding. For joining two together, use identical frames. For joining three together, choose either three of the same or one which is larger to be the middle frame. Lay them beside each other to see if you like the effect. Put two frames together back to back, and mark the hinge placement. The placement must be the same distance from the bottom edges of each frame to ensure that the grouped pictures stand securely on the table top. Attach two small hinges to the connecting sides of the frames.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to attach multiple picture frames together: First, select two or three frames of the same wood molding. For joining two together, use identical frames. For joining three together, choose either three of the same or one which is larger to be the middle frame. Lay them beside each other to see if you like the effect. Put two frames together back to back, and mark the hinge placement. The placement must be the same distance from the bottom edges of each frame to ensure that the grouped pictures stand securely on the table top. Attach two small hinges to the connecting sides of the frames.", "time_sec": 10.782, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 14722, 6245, 13083, 24751, 5823, 1058, 7610, 1044, 5762, 2295, 1505, 3300, 24751, 1307, 1278, 2879, 12603, 75224, 1046, 2898, 31427, 2295, 5823, 1044, 2210, 18535, 24751, 1046, 2898, 31427, 3300, 5823, 1044, 12729, 5250, 3300, 1307, 1278, 2879, 1505, 1925, 1799, 1395, 9039, 1317, 1402, 1278, 9949, 6448, 1046, 57340, 2424, 25644, 2744, 2147, 1317, 3219, 1693, 1636, 2479, 1278, 2851, 1046, 21374, 2295, 24751, 5823, 2595, 1317, 2595, 1044, 1321, 3780, 1278, 72443, 30880, 1046, 1531, 30880, 4016, 1402, 1278, 2879, 7786, 1562, 1278, 9478, 20978, 1307, 2744, 6448, 1317, 11811, 1455, 1278, 43404, 23874, 3679, 98053, 1408, 1278, 4234, 3977, 1046, 10436, 1664, 2295, 3709, 26268, 1264, 1317, 1278, 22460, 15819, 1307, 1278, 24751, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.002, -0.5673, -0.0001, -0.019, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.181, -0.967, -0.0177, -0.0833, -0.0357, -0.0025, -0.0025, -0.1324, -0.0081, -0.0086, -0.0, -0.0016, -0.0, -0.5393, -0.0452, -0.0008, -0.0001, -0.578, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0006, -0.0, -0.1861, -0.04, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0041, -0.0, -0.0037, -0.0125, -0.0001, -0.021, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2409, -0.0001, -0.2288, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0198, -0.0629, -0.0076, -0.0014, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0725, -0.0337, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0116, -0.0724, -0.0042, -0.0003, -0.0019, -0.0, -0.0, -0.