{"id": "221", "question": "how to peel potatoes fast", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to peel potatoes fast:\n\n1. Score the potatoes all the way around the center with a knife.\n2. Boil the potatoes for about 15 minutes.\n3. Place the potatoes in a bowl of ice water and swish them around for a few seconds.\n4. Remove the potatoes from the water and remove the skin.\n\nAlternatively, you can also try the following method:\n\n1. Cut the potato skin, making a cut all around the potato lengthwise.\n2. Boil the potato in a pot of boiling water.\n3. Plunge the potato in ice water for 10 seconds.\n4. Rub the potato with both hands, and the skin should fall right off.\n\nThese methods should help you peel potatoes quickly and efficiently.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to peel potatoes fast: First, cut the potato skin lengthwise all around the potato, slicing only the skin (passage 3, step 1). Then, boil the potato in a pot of boiling water for about 15 minutes (passage 2, step 3). Next, plunge the potato in ice water for 10 seconds to cool it and cause the skin to shrink (passage 3, step 3). Finally, rub the potato with both hands to remove the skin easily (passage 3, step 4). Passage 1 also notes that the \"shocking\" process of moving from hot to cold water helps release the skin, making peeling easier. Passage 2 emphasizes that this method is the easiest way discovered for peeling a large quantity of potatoes quickly.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to peel potatoes fast: First, cut the potato skin lengthwise all around the potato, slicing only the skin (passage 3, step 1). Then, boil the potato in a pot of boiling water for about 15 minutes (passage 2, step 3). Next, plunge the potato in ice water for 10 seconds to cool it and cause the skin to shrink (passage 3, step 3). Finally, rub the potato with both hands to remove the skin easily (passage 3, step 4). Passage 1 also notes that the \"shocking\" process of moving from hot to cold water helps release the skin, making peeling easier. Passage 2 emphasizes that this method is the easiest way discovered for peeling a large quantity of potatoes quickly.", "time_sec": 16.572, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 116439, 73710, 7720, 1058, 7610, 1044, 6945, 1278, 68334, 9877, 5592, 8493, 1747, 3879, 1278, 68334, 1044, 34340, 1302, 2342, 1278, 9877, 1319, 12107, 1541, 1032, 1051, 1044, 5966, 1032, 1049, 1577, 6830, 1044, 75766, 1278, 68334, 1294, 1261, 3418, 1307, 64819, 4180, 1394, 2314, 1032, 1049, 1053, 7334, 1319, 12107, 1541, 1032, 1050, 1044, 5966, 1032, 1051, 1577, 18147, 1044, 1615, 33968, 1278, 68334, 1294, 16254, 4180, 1394, 1032, 1049, 1048, 12900, 1317, 12921, 1494, 1321, 6706, 1278, 9877, 1317, 51958, 1319, 12107, 1541, 1032, 1051, 1044, 5966, 1032, 1051, 1577, 15513, 1044, 13523, 1278, 68334, 1454, 2960, 8004, 1317, 8559, 1278, 9877, 10421, 1319, 12107, 1541, 1032, 1051, 1044, 5966, 1032, 1052, 1577, 103039, 1032, 1049, 2095, 15031, 1455, 1278, 1429, 2958, 2017, 1302, 1034, 2832, 1307, 11090, 1562, 8480, 1317, 13074, 4180, 16348, 8021, 1278, 9877, 1044, 6187, 2135, 21427, 16163, 1046, 103039, 1032, 1050, 72250, 1455, 1593, 2866, 1395, 1278, 58721, 3039, 16757, 1394, 2135, 21427, 1261, 4329, 18819, 1307, 73710, 10533, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.6584, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0007, -0.076, -0.9774, -0.0434, -1.3735, -0.0704, -0.0021, -0.0186, -0.4324, -0.0, -0.141, -0.0263, -0.654, -0.0018, -0.107, -0.1002, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0012, -0.824, -0.4935, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.8758, -0.4742, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0215, -0.6645, -0.1291, -0.1198, -0.0036, -0.0812, -0.0049, -0.0107, -0.0, -0.00