{"id": "233", "question": "average weather sausalito", "gt": "The highest monthly average temperature in Sausalito is 58 degrees in September and the lowest is 50 degrees in December. The city gets 34 inches of rain per year, with the most precipitation occurring in January. Snowfall is non-existent. On average, there are 256 sunny days per year. The July high is around 69 degrees and the January low is 43. The air quality index is 13% better than the national average, however, the pollution index is 61% worse.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, average weather in Sausalito includes a July high of around 69 degrees, a January low of 43 degrees, 34 inches of rain per year, 0 inches of snowfall, 56 days with any measurable precipitation, 256 sunny days per year, and a Sperling's comfort index of 84 out of 100, which is higher than the US average of 54 and based on days within the 70-80 degree comfort range with humidity penalties.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, average weather in Sausalito includes a July high of around 69 degrees, a January low of 43 degrees, 34 inches of rain per year, 0 inches of snowfall, 56 days with any measurable precipitation, 256 sunny days per year, and a Sperling's comfort index of 84 out of 100, which is higher than the US average of 54 and based on days within the 70-80 degree comfort range with humidity penalties.", "time_sec": 11.604, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 6931, 17253, 1294, 1335, 64457, 3424, 6987, 1261, 6776, 2738, 1307, 3879, 1032, 1054, 1057, 17633, 1044, 1261, 6866, 4253, 1307, 1032, 1052, 1051, 17633, 1044, 1032, 1051, 1052, 29466, 1307, 17378, 1651, 2637, 1044, 1032, 1048, 29466, 1307, 23745, 1449