{"id": "235", "question": "average weather sausalito", "gt": "Average weather in Sausalito can vary depending on the time of year. For example, during September, the average temperature is 58 degrees Fahrenheit (15 degrees Celsius), while in January, it is only 43 degrees Fahrenheit (4 degrees Celsius). The most precipitation occurs in January with 0 inches. However, throughout the year, the number of days with measurable precipitation is 56, and there are an average of 256 sunny days.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, average weather in Sausalito includes a July high of around 69 degrees, a January low of 43 degrees, 34 inches of rain per year, 0 inches of snowfall, 56 days with any measurable precipitation, 256 sunny days per year, and a Sperling's comfort index of 84 out of 100, which is higher than the US average of 54 and based on days within the 70-80 degree comfort range with humidity penalties.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, average weather in Sausalito includes a July high of around 69 degrees, a January low of 43 degrees, 34 inches of rain per year, 0 inches of snowfall, 56 days with any measurable precipitation, 256 sunny days per year, and a Sperling's comfort index of 84 out of 100, which is higher than the US average of 54 and based on days within the 70-80 degree comfort range with humidity penalties.", "time_sec": 12.693, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 6931, 17253, 1294, 1335, 64457, 3424, 6987, 1261, 6776, 2738, 1307, 3879, 1032, 1054, 1057, 17633, 1044, 1261, 6866, 4253, 1307, 1032, 1052, 1051, 17633, 1044, 1032, 1051, 1052, 29466, 1307, 17378, 1651, 2637, 1044, 1032, 1048, 29466, 1307, 23745, 14490, 1044, 1032, 1053, 1054,