{"id": "236", "question": "average weather sausalito", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the average weather in Sausalito can be summarized as follows:\n\n* Temperature: The average temperature in Sausalito ranges from 50°F (December) to 58°F (September).\n* Precipitation: Sausalito receives an average of 34 inches of rain per year, with the most precipitation occurring in January (0 inches).\n* Air Quality Index: The air quality index in Sausalito is 13% better than the national average, but the pollution index is 61% worse than the national average.\n* Sunshine: Sausalito experiences 256 sunny days per year, with an average of 56 days with measurable precipitation.\n* Comfort Index: According to Sperling's comfort index, Sausalito has a score of 84 out of 100, indicating a comfortable year-round climate.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages regarding the average weather in Sausalito during a specific month or time period.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, average weather in Sausalito includes a July high of around 69 degrees, a January low of 43 degrees, 34 inches of rain per year, 0 inches of snowfall, 56 days with any measurable precipitation, 256 sunny days per year, and a Sperling's comfort index of 84 out of 100, which is higher than the US average of 54 and based on days within the 70-80 degree comfort range with humidity penalties.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, average weather in Sausalito includes a July high of around 69 degrees, a January low of 43 degrees, 34 inches of rain per year, 0 inches of snowfall, 56 days with any measurable precipitation, 256 sunny days per year, and a Sperling's comfort index of 84 out of 100, which is higher than the US average of 54 and based on days within the 70-80 degree comfort range with humidity penalties.", "time_sec": 10.482, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-r