{"id": "260", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "MSM powder offers several benefits. It helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, thereby increasing energy levels. It also makes cell walls more permeable. The powder aids in the absorption of more nutrients, particularly when paired with Co-enzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains and reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include: helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) with co-enzyme Q10 requiring MSM for full utilization, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by addressing cellular water pressure imbalances.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include: helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) with co-enzyme Q10 requiring MSM for full utilization, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by addressing cellular water pressure imbalances.", "time_sec": 8.581, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 15021, 1307, 13172, 1077, 22797, 4626, 1058, 22763, 2012, 14297, 2203, 1278, 6517, 2081, 34737, 1454, 1278, 2879, 5647, 1307, 2196, 1044, 8035, 6091, 5283, 15