{"id": "265", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n* Helping to increase oxygen efficiency in the blood\n* Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\n* Enhancing nutrient absorption, particularly when taken with Co-enzyme Q10\n* Relieving muscular aches and pains\n* Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis\n\nTherefore, MSM powder has several benefits for overall health and wellness, including improved oxygenation, energy, and reduction of pain and inflammation.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include: helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) with co-enzyme Q10 requiring MSM for full utilization, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by addressing cellular water pressure imbalances.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include: helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, helping absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) with co-enzyme Q10 requiring MSM for full utilization, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by addressing cellular water pressure imbalances.", "time_sec": 9.241, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 15021, 1307, 13172, 1077, 22