{"id": "272", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, cramping, nausea, and vomiting.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include a missed period, bloating, spotting, cramping, mood swings, and dizziness. Passage 2 states that many women know a missed period may indicate pregnancy, but also notes bloating, spotting, and cramping as easily overlooked early signs. Passage 1 describes mood swings resulting from hormonal changes and dizziness caused by blood vessel dilation and dropping blood pressure. Passage 3 mentions nausea and vomiting occurring around six weeks after the last period, which is also an early symptom.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include a missed period, bloating, spotting, cramping, mood swings, and dizziness. Passage 2 states that many women know a missed period may indicate pregnancy, but also notes bloating, spotting, and cramping as easily overlooked early signs. Passage 1 describes mood swings resulting from hormonal changes and dizziness caused by blood vessel dilation and dropping blood pressure. Passage 3 mentions nausea and vomiting occurring around six weeks after the last period, which is also an early symptom.", "time_sec": 11.23, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 32914, 18336, 1321, 11929, 1307, 22653, 4626, 1261, 21957, 4279, 1044, 17744, 2283, 1044, 1942, 29539, 1044, 2989, 35077, 1044, 26380, 130536, 1044, 1321, 1266, 13706, 4555, 1046, 103039, 1032, 1050, 8164, 1455, 3325, 5343, 2840, 1261, 21957, 4