{"id": "276", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "gt": "Severe osteoporosis is a condition characterized by significant bone density loss, resulting in weakened bones and increased risk of fractures. Symptoms may include sudden and severe back pain, loss of height over time, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, fractures, particularly in the spine or hips, are likely to occur.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, severe osteoporosis is a condition where bone density loss has progressed to the point that bones become so weak they can compress, leading to symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones, often occurring without a fall or injury, particularly in the spine or hips which support the body's weight.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, severe osteoporosis is a condition where bone density loss has progressed to the point that bones become so weak they can compress, leading to symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones, often occurring without a fall or injury, particularly in the spine or hips which support the body's weight.", "time_sec": 8.963, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 13015, 95833, 1395, 1261, 6570, 2478, 12442, 10154, 6410, 1934, 67742, 1317, 1278, 2862, 1455, 35246, 6127, 1878, 10824, 2127, 1710, 33469, 1044, 8924, 1317, 11929, 2516, 1435, 2595, 6890, 1044, 6410, 1307, 5806, 2136, 2142, 1454, 1261, 18037, 23193, 58497, 1044, 1321, 46700, 1307, 1278, 126893, 1044, 105601, 1044, 43543, 1044, 1505, 2147, 