{"id": "310", "question": "avg cost to install a second floor in a house", "gt": "Hiring a remodeling contractor to build a second floor addition can cost between $100-$300 a square foot for a typical addition, but the cost can go as high as $400-$500 per square foot depending on the complexity, quality of materials and local labor rates. Building a second floor can cost at least 20 percent more than building the same square footage at ground level.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house ranges from $100-$300 per square foot for a typical addition (2-3 bedrooms and a bath plus a flight of stairs), but can go as high as $400-$500 per square foot depending on complexity, quality of materials and local labor rates. Building a second floor can add much-needed space but costs at least 20 percent more than building the same square footage at ground level.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house ranges from $100-$300 per square foot for a typical addition (2-3 bedrooms and a bath plus a flight of stairs), but can go as high as $400-$500 per square foot depending on complexity, quality of materials and local labor rates. Building a second floor can add much-needed space but costs at least 20 percent more than building the same square footage at ground level.", "time_sec": 9.523, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 6931, 4362, 1317, 7450, 1261, 2667, 11237, 1294, 1261, 5718, 26236, 1562, 1659, 1049, 1048, 1048, 77960, 1051, 1048, 1048, 1651, 12333, 7537, 1394, 1261, 15421, 3988, 1319, 1050, 1045, 1051, 107953, 1321, 1261, 19436, 2984, 1261, 18034, 1307, 356