{"id": "321", "question": "what is the effect of carbon footprint", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of an individual's lifestyle and daily activities, specifically the amount of greenhouse gases produced, such as carbon dioxide, as a result of those activities. The carbon footprint is typically measured in tons of CO2 released into the atmosphere. The passages also mention that reducing one's carbon footprint can have a significant impact on the environment, even with seemingly small changes. Additionally, the average carbon footprint is mentioned to be around 6 tons per year, with a higher amount in the US due to automobile emissions.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the effect of carbon footprint is that it measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle, indicating the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of your daily activities, with the concept being that everything you do has a positive or negative impact on the environment.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the effect of carbon footprint is that it measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle, indicating the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of your daily activities, with the concept being that everything you do has a positive or negative impact on the environment.", "time_sec": 5.89, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 2851, 1307, 10006, 87732, 1395, 1455, 1494, 11778, 1278, 13412, 7060, 1307, 2143, 37282, 1044, 14655, 1278, 5647, 1307, 10006, 42812, 1321, 2147, 69925, 41060, 8077, 1435, 1261, 2282, 1307, 2143, 12499, 9216,