{"id": "438", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\n\n1. Check the French White Pages (in English): You can use the website pagesjaunes.fr to search for people in France. To search for someone in Paris or its suburbs, enter \"IDF\" (Ile de France) in the department or region field instead of typing Paris.\n2. Use the nom field to enter the last name of the person you are looking for, and you can also include their first name in the prenom field.\n3. Provide address information, if known, in the ou section to refine your search.\n4. Click \"trouver\" to search for the name, and the search results will display name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\n\nNote that the effectiveness of these methods may depend on how up-to-date the information in the white pages is and whether the person you are looking for has listed their contact information publicly.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to find someone in France: Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr (the French white pages). Enter the person's last name in the Nom field and their first name in the Prenom field. If you know their address, enter it in the Ou section; otherwise, leave it blank to search the entire country. Click Trouver to search. Alternatively, send an email or letter to the town hall in the city where the person was born (e.g., Paris, Avignon, Bordeaux, Lyon, Nice). For better results, try using IDF (Ile de France) instead of Paris in the Dept district or region field on the French white pages search. You can also try posting a missed connection on Paris Craigslist. Additionally, try to find the person's middle name, as it often helps identify the correct individual.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to find someone in France: Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr (the French white pages). Enter the person's last name in the Nom field and their first name in the Prenom field. If you know their address, enter it in the Ou section; otherwise, leave it blank to search the entire country. Click Trouver to search. Alternatively, send an email or letter to the town hall in the city where the person was born (e.g., Paris, Avignon, Bordeaux, Lyon, Nice). For better results, try using IDF (Ile de France) instead of Paris in the Dept district or region field on the French white pages search. You can also try posting a missed connection on Paris Craigslist. Additionally, try to find the person's middle name, as it often helps identify the correct individual.", "time_sec": 13.479, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 3081, 8381, 1294, 5498, 1058, 41631, 28187, 120697, 2922, 12814, 61385, 1319, 3265, 8689, 7496, 13536, 1577, 14669, 1278, 2965, 1681, 3804, 2564, 1294, 1278, 30607, 3727, 1321, 2034, 2158, 2564, 1294, 1278, 1390, 2358, 1313, 3727, 1046, 3367, 1636, 2840, 2034, 5751, 1044, 6889, 1494, 1294, 1278, 34746, 6079, 1059, 12233, 1044, 9288, 1494, 17822, 1317, 6123, 1278, 6960, 6816, 1046, 30476, 1353, 1618, 1465, 1317, 6123, 1046, 37346, 1044, 8160, 1420, 8686, 1505, 10679, 1317, 1278, 8256, 12361, 1294, 1278, 5970, 2478, 1278, 2965, 1486, 14614, 1319, 1101, 3596, 3109, 6993, 1044, 9554, 42581, 1044, 44917, 1044, 30644, 1044, 39755, 1577, 2898, 4942, 3657, 1044, 3352, 2505, 7513, 1070, 1319, 1073, 1282, 1311, 5498, 1041, 6302, 1307, 6993, 1294, 1278, 2491, 1515, 13375, 1505, 5578, 3727, 1408, 1278, 8689, 7496, 13536, 6123, 1046, 3213, 1710, 2095, 3352, 49144, 1261, 21957, 7936, 1408, 6993, 33190, 1115, 6059, 1046, 18011, 1044, 3352, 1317, 3081, 1278, 2965, 1681, 9949, 2564, 1044, 1435, 1494, 5153, 16348, 9086, 1278, 6298, 4597, 1046, 11], "log