{"id": "461", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Cupping massage has several benefits. It is known to help eliminate toxins from the body and improve blood circulation. It also aids in pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation, which subsequently improves flexibility and increases range of motion. Additionally, cupping massage has mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, benefits of cupping massage include: 1 Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2 Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3 Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression. 4 (Note: Passage 1 mentions \"five biggest cupping benefits\" but does not list them, so only the specific benefits from passages 2 and 3 are included as they directly address the question).", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, benefits of cupping massage include: 1 Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2 Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3 Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression. 4 (Note: Passage 1 mentions \"five biggest cupping benefits\" but does not list them, so only the specific benefits from passages 2 and 3 are included as they directly address the question).", "time_sec": 12.298, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-