{"id": "469", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of hiking as a hobby:\n\n1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health (Passage 1).\n2. Hiking can help increase your levels of vitamin D through exposure to sunshine (Passage 2).\n3. Hiking has a positive impact on combating symptoms of stress and anxiety (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, the main benefits of hiking as a hobby are its positive effects on mental health, physical health, and stress reduction.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, benefits of hiking as a hobby facts include: it is inexpensive and easy to start, allowing participation regardless of current fitness level; it promotes mental health by being more varied than gym exercise; exposure to sunshine increases vitamin D levels; it is a cardiovascular activity that reduces heart disease risk and increases overall fitness; and research shows it positively impacts combating stress and anxiety symptoms, as noted by Gregory A. Miller, PhD, president of the American Hiking Society, who states being in nature is ingrained in our DNA.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, benefits of hiking as a hobby facts include: it is inexpensive and easy to start, allowing participation regardless of current fitness level; it promotes mental health by being more varied than gym exercise; exposure to sunshine increases vitamin D levels; it is a cardiovascular activity that reduces heart disease risk and increases overall fitness; and research shows it positively impacts combating stress and anxiety symptoms, as noted by Gregory A. Miller, PhD, president of the American Hiking Society, who states being in nature is ingrained in our DNA.", "time_sec": 14.978, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false