{"id": "483", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that Snapchat may lock accounts that use third-party applications to access the platform more than four times. If a user has been locked out of their account and doesn't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. Third-party apps are applications that are not developed or officially supported by Snapchat, such as third-party messaging or camera apps. Using these apps may put the user's account at risk, as well as their friends'. Additionally, there are many reasons why people are getting locked out of Snapchat, including using third-party apps.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and may result in account lockout as stated in passage 2 (\"if you are using third party apps, at the moment the only thing you can do is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone\") and passage 3 (\"We've noticed that you're using a third-party application to access Snapchat, putting yourself (and possibly your friends) at risk\"). Passage 1 also confirms this issue when it states that using third-party apps can lead to account warnings and lockouts, noting \"if you used third-party apps to get into snapchat and they warned you more them 4 times then yes your account is locked\" and that \"they warned me 3 times, I changed my password and it did unlock it but on the 4th time I tried and nothing.\"", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and may result in account lockout as stated in passage 2 (\"if you are using third party apps, at the moment the only thing you can do is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone\") and passage 3 (\"We've noticed that you're using a third-party application to access Snapchat, putting yourself (and possibly your friends) at risk\"). Passage 1 also confirms this issue when it states that using third-party apps can lead to account warnings and lockouts, noting \"if you used third-party apps to get into snapchat and they warned you more them 4 times then yes your account is locked\" and that \"they warned me 3 times, I changed my password and it did unlock it but on the 4th time I tried and nothing.\"", "time_sec": 22.111, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 2143, 97700, 11274, 5449, 1395, 39833, 27812, 3147, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 10792, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 1799, 6938, 2130, 97700, 11274, 1681, 10098, 17973, 1321, 2188, 2282, 1294, 5449, 10066, 1660, 1435, 11383, 1294, 14456, 1032, 1050, 7504, 1391, 1636, 1584, 2505, 5888, 8967, 28026, 1044, 1513, 1278, 4735, 1278, 2342, 6588, 1636, 1710, 1653, 1395, 1317, 106297, 1455, 2118, 1321, 7377, 1394, 1420, 9481, 97700, 11274, 2118, 1317, 6730, 1394, 1278, 10986, 42743, 4428, 1321, 14456, 1032, 1051, 7504, 4268, 6483, 19794, 1455, 1636, 6185, 2505, 1261, 5888, 49209, 5510, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 21443, 14019, 1319, 1421, 15717, 2143, 10989, 1041, 1513, 5735, 5588, 103039, 1032, 1049, 2095, 58568, 1593, 6769, 2200, 1494, 8164, 1455, 2505, 5888, 49209, 28026, 1710, 3820, 1317, 5449, 46933, 1321, 10066, 27330, 1044, 41165, 1429, 1391, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 28026, 1317, 2012, 2203, 26064, 11274, 1321, 2127, 42706, 1636, 2081, 2424, 1032, 1052, 5213, 2430, 14842, 2143, 5449, 1395, 27812, 1034, 1321, 1455, 1429, 43880, 42706, 1639, 1032, 