{"id": "484", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is why your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked:\n\n1. Using third-party apps to access Snapchat without authorization: According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee the security of accounts accessed through third-party apps. If you have been using such apps, it could result in your account being locked.\n2. Exceeding the limit of warnings for third-party app usage: Passage 1 mentions that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts that use third-party apps excessively. If you have exceeded the limit of warnings, your account might be temporarily locked.\n\nTherefore, the most likely reason for your Snapchat account being temporarily locked is due to the unauthorized use of third-party apps.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and may result in account lockout as stated in passage 2 (\"if you are using third party apps, at the moment the only thing you can do is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone\") and passage 3 (\"We've noticed that you're using a third-party application to access Snapchat, putting yourself (and possibly your friends) at risk\"). Passage 1 also confirms this issue when it states that using third-party apps can lead to account warnings and lockouts, noting \"if you used third-party apps to get into snapchat and they warned you more them 4 times then yes your account is locked\" and that \"they warned me 3 times, I changed my password and it did unlock it but on the 4th time I tried and nothing.\"", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and may result in account lockout as stated in passage 2 (\"if you are using third party apps, at the moment the only thing you can do is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone\") and passage 3 (\"We've noticed that you're using a third-party application to access Snapchat, putting yourself (and possibly your friends) at risk\"). Passage 1 also confirms this issue when it states that using third-party apps can lead to account warnings and lockouts, noting \"if you used third-party apps to get into snapchat and they warned you more them 4 times then yes your account is locked\" and that \"they warned me 3 times, I changed my password and it did unlock it but on the 4th time I tried and nothing.\"", "time_sec": 24.635, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 2143, 97700, 11274, 5449, 1395, 39833, 27812, 3147, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 10792, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 1799, 6938, 2130, 97700, 11274, 1681, 10098, 17973, 1321, 2188, 2282, 1294, 5449, 10066, 1660, 1435, 11383, 1294, 14456, 1032, 1050, 7504, 1391, 1636, 1584, 2505, 5888, 8967, 28026, 1044, 1513, 1278, 4735, 1278, 2342, 6588, 1636, 1710, 1653, 1395, 1317, 106297, 1455, 2118, 1321, 7377, 1394, 1420, 9481, 97700, 11274, 2118, 1317, 6730, 1394, 1278, 10986, 42743, 4428, 1321, 14456, 1032, 1051, 7504, 4268, 6483, 19794, 1455, 1636, 6185, 2505, 1261, 5888, 49209, 5510, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 21443, 14019, 1319, 1421, 15717, 2143, 10989, 1041, 1513, 5735, 5588, 103039, 1032, 1049, 2095, 58568, 1593, 6769, 2200, 1494, 8164, 1455, 2505, 5888, 49209, 28026, 1710, 3820, 1317, 5449, 46933, 1321, 10066, 27330, 1044, 41165, 1429, 1391, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 28026, 1317, 2012, 220