{"id": "485", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, it appears that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked due to using third-party apps. According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee security when using third-party apps, and they may lock your account if they detect such usage. Passage 3 also mentions that Snapchat has taken steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could result in account lockout.\n\nIt's possible that you have been warned multiple times by Snapchat about using third-party apps, as mentioned in passage 1, and your account has been locked as a result. To regain access to your account, you may need to stop using third-party apps and wait for an official Snapchat app to become available for your device, as suggested in passage 2.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and may result in account lockout as stated in passage 2 (\"if you are using third party apps, at the moment the only thing you can do is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone\") and passage 3 (\"We've noticed that you're using a third-party application to access Snapchat, putting yourself (and possibly your friends) at risk\"). Passage 1 also confirms this issue when it states that using third-party apps can lead to account warnings and lockouts, noting \"if you used third-party apps to get into snapchat and they warned you more them 4 times then yes your account is locked\" and that \"they warned me 3 times, I changed my password and it did unlock it but on the 4th time I tried and nothing.\"", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party applications to access Snapchat, which violates Snapchat's security policies and may result in account lockout as stated in passage 2 (\"if you are using third party apps, at the moment the only thing you can do is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone\") and passage 3 (\"We've noticed that you're using a third-party application to access Snapchat, putting yourself (and possibly your friends) at risk\"). Passage 1 also confirms this issue when it states that using third-party apps can lead to account warnings and lockouts, noting \"if you used third-party apps to get into snapchat and they warned you more them 4 times then yes your account is locked\" and that \"they warned me 3 times, I changed my password and it did unlock it but on the 4th time I tried and nothing.\"", "time_sec": 22.316, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 2143, 97700, 11274, 5449, 1395, 39833, 27812, 3147, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 10792, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 1799, 6938, 2130, 97700, 11274, 1681, 10098, 17973, 1321, 2188, 2282, 1294, 5449, 10066, 1660, 1435, 11383, 1294, 14456, 1032, 1050, 7504, 1391, 1636, 1584, 2505, 5888, 8967, 28026, 1044, 1513, 1278, 4735, 1278, 2342, 6588, 1636, 1710, 1653, 1395, 1317, 106297, 1455, 2118, 1321, 7377, 1394, 1420, 9481, 97700, 11274, 2118, 1317, 6730, 1394, 1278, 10986, 42743, 4428, 1321, 14456, 1032, 1051, 7504, 4268, 6483, 19794, 1455, 1636, 6185, 2505, 1261, 5888, 49209, 5510, 1317, 4731, 97700, 11274, 1044, 21443, 14019, 1319, 1421, 15717, 2143, 10989, 1041, 1513, 5735, 5588, 103039, 1032, 1049, 2095, 58568, 1593, 6769, 2200, 1494, 8164, 1455, 2505, 5888, 49209, 28026, 1710, 3820, 1317, 5449, 46933, 1321, 10066, 27330, 1044, 41165, 1429, 1391, 1636, 2434, 5888, 49209, 28026, 13