en-F1": 47.34, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "488", "question": "how to plan a trip to germany", "gt": "To plan a trip to Germany, it is important to plan ahead and be aware of the rules and regulations regarding travel with pets. It is also recommended to research the best ways to save money during your trip, such as looking into discounted flights, cheap hotels and hostels, and affordable dining options. Additionally, learning about German life and culture can enhance your overall trip experience.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to plan a trip to Germany, you should check out helpful Germany travel tips which include visa requirements, deciding when and where to go in Germany, identifying what to see in Germany, and learning about getting around in Germany. Additionally, you can read about air travel with pets, vaccinations for pets, and pet-friendly hotels in Germany if traveling with a pet, and learn the rules for pets on German trains.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to plan a trip to Germany, you should check out helpful Germany travel tips which include visa requirements, deciding when and where to go in Germany, identifying what to see in Germany, and learning about getting around in Germany. Additionally, you can read about air travel with pets, vaccinations for pets, and pet-friendly hotels in Germany if traveling with a pet, and learn the rules for pets on German trains.", "time_sec": 9.216, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 4777, 1261, 17336, 1317, 10787, 1044, 1636, 2715, 4206, 1848, 20351, 10787, 10601, 32541, 1799, 4626, 54149, 13795, 1044, 52751, 2200, 1321, 2478, 1317, 1974, 1294, 10787, 1044, 25330, 2549, 1317, 3219, 1294, 10787, 1044, 1321, 9055, 2314, 779