{"id": "504", "question": "what are the characteristics of tropical rainforest floor", "gt": "The floor of a tropical rainforest biome is characterized by a fast rate of decay due to the heat and moisture. This decay provides rich nutrients for other plants to grow. Various types of fruits, nuts, herbs, and mushrooms grow on the rainforest floor. Additionally, vines and ferns grow all over the rainforest, including the floor, helping to connect the various layers of the biome.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the characteristics of the tropical rainforest floor include: herbs and mushrooms that grow on the floor, and the presence of vines and ferns that help connect the various layers of the biome. Additionally, due to the heat and moisture, plants and animals that die in this location rot quickly, with their decay providing rich nutrients for other plants to grow from.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the characteristics of the tropical rainforest floor include: herbs and mushrooms that grow on the floor, and the presence of vines and ferns that help connect the various layers of the biome. Additionally, due to the heat and moisture, plants and animals that die in this location rot quickly, with their decay providing rich nutrients for other plants to grow from.", "time_sec": 8.06, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 10169, 1307, 1278, 24170, 17378, 106761, 11237, 4626, 1058, 81991, 1321, 125404, 1455, 4492, 1408, 1278, 11237, 1044, 1321, 1278, 7361, 1307, 1330, 2783, 1321, 1284, 63786, 1455, 3508, 8044, 1278, 5561, 14953, 1307, 1278, 105789, 1046, 18011, 1044, 3964, 1317, 1278, 9374, 1321, 39493, 1044, 12474, 1321, 11115, 1455, 1828, 1294, 1593, 7285, 6554, 10533, 1044, 1454, 2034, 32027, 11495, 12478, 48824, 1394, 2147, 12474, 1317, 4492, 1562, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.002, -0.0888, -0.0392, -0.0, -0.1143, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0022, -0.0266, -0.3669, -0.2934, -0.0164, -0.0001, -0.6488, -0.0, -0.0049, -0.0, -0.0012, -0.2683, -0.534, -0.7724, -0.874, -0.0, -0.2047, -0.0, -0.0101, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0248, -0.1512, -0.0076, -0.0233, -0.004, -0.0005, -0.2675, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.3685, -0.6769, -0.0, -0.3449, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0151, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.1072, -0.0795, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.002, -0.0, -0.2271, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0299, -0.279, -0.1891, -0.0, -0.062, -0.0144, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0032, 0.0, -0.0142, -0.0071, -0.1033], "cumulative_logprob": -7.272, "norm_logp": -0.0921, "input_len": 646, "output_tokens": 79, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 57.5, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "507", "question": "what are the characteristics of tropical rainforest floor", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the characteristics of the tropical rainforest floor are:\n\n1. High levels of rainfall, with some areas receiving up to 400 inches of rain annually.\n2. High humidity due to the large amount of rainfall.\n3. Abundant vegetation, including tall trees, vines, ferns, herbs, mushrooms, fruits, and nuts.\n4. Quick decay of plant and animal matter due to the heat and moisture, which provides rich nutrients for other plants to grow.\n5. Presence of bananas growing on vines.\n\nTherefore, the tropical rainforest floor is characterized by high rainfall, humidity, and lush vegetation, with a diverse array of plant species and a rapid rate of decay and nutrient cycling.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the characteristics of the tropical rainforest floor include: herbs and mushrooms that grow on the floor, and the presence of vines and ferns that help connect the various layers of the biome. Additionally, due to the heat and moisture, plants and animals that die in this location rot quickly, with their decay providing rich nutrients for other plants to grow from.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the characteristics of the tropical rainforest floor include: herbs and mushrooms that grow on the floor, and the presence of vines and ferns that help connect the various layers of the biome. Additionally, due to the heat and moisture, plants and animals that die in this location rot quickly, with their decay providing rich nutrients for other plants to grow from.", "time_sec": 8.019, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 10169, 1307, 1278,