{"id": "522", "question": "temperature for tallahassee florida", "gt": "Tallahassee, Florida has an overall average high temperature of 79 degrees and an average low of 56 degrees. Freezing temperatures can sporadically occur from November to March, with two or three nights on average even dropping to 20 °F or lower.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, Tallahassee, Florida has an average high temperature of 79 degrees and an average low of 56 degrees, with freezing temperatures occurring sporadically from November to March, including two or three nights on average when temperatures drop to 20 °F (-8 °C) or lower, and rare events where temperatures never rise above 32 °F, typically happening once a decade.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, Tallahassee, Florida has an average high temperature of 79 degrees and an average low of 56 degrees, with freezing temperatures occurring sporadically from November to March, including two or three nights on average when temperatures drop to 20 °F (-8 °C) or lower, and rare events where temperatures never rise above 32 °F, typically happening once a decade.", "time_sec": 13.652, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 33739, 1816, 1288, 6270, 1044, 17940, 1934, 1420, 6931, 2738, 6138, 1307, 1032, 1055, 1057, 17633, 1321, 1420, 6931, 4253, 1307, 1032, 1053, 1054, 17633, 1044, 1454, 54815, 18548, 26454, 32330, 1332, 2981, 1562, 6032, 1317, 6346, 1044, 3907, 2295, 1505, 3300, 43724, 1408, 6931, 2200, 18548, 11480, 1317, 1032, 1050, 1048, 6885, 1070, 17522, 1056, 6885, 1067, 1041, 1505, 4953, 1044, 1321, 11191, 7129, 2478, 18548, 4772, 14851, 4455, 1032, 1051, 1050, 6885, 1070, 1044, 12837, 24300, 5785, 1261, 25073, 1046, 11