{"id": "542", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "People born in October are described as having a keen interest in and an eye for form and structure, which can make them good architects, interior decorators, designers, or any profession that combines art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals. They are at their best when they are in control, their own boss, or working on their own. They can also get along with others and possess necessary \"people skills\", although they can occasionally show impatience. Despite being restless at heart, they crave stability and security, which is why they work hard at whatever they do.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have the following traits: If born on October 14, they have a great interest in and eye for form and structure, making them suitable for professions like architect, interior decorator, or designer. If born on October 1, they are success-oriented, charming, personally powerful, and thrive when in control or working independently, though they may show impatience and possess strong people skills. If born on October 5, they are restless at heart but crave stability and security, which drives their hard work.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have the following traits: If born on October 14, they have a great interest in and eye for form and structure, making them suitable for professions like architect, interior decorator, or designer. If born on October 1, they are success-oriented, charming, personally powerful, and thrive when in control or working independently, though they may show impatience and possess strong people skills. If born on October 5, they are restless at heart but crave stability and security, which drives their hard work.", "ti