{"id": "573", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can start by identifying all possible entry points that mice use to get into your house. Once identified, consider putting steel wool inside these holes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent the mice from using these paths to re-enter your home. By doing so, you eliminate their access to food or shelter in your house, which can help in getting rid of them quickly.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice you need to take immediate action as it is a critical step. Mice can very quickly take up residence and start nesting, so act fast. Consider putting steel wool inside entry points like pipes or vents before sealing them off, as steel wool pads prevent mice from using the hole to get back in and add extra protection if mice are persistent. Also, eliminate food sources and seal tiny openings to prevent access, as rodents consume human-discarded food and fit through the tiniest openings.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice you need to take immediate action as it is a critical step. Mice can very quickly take up residence and start nesting, so act fast. Consider putting steel wool inside entry points like pipes or vents before sealing them off, as steel wool pads prevent mice from using the hole to get back in and add extra protection if mice are persistent. Also, eliminate food sources and seal tiny openings to prevent access, as rodents consume human-discarded food and fit through the tiniest openings.", "time_sec": 11.87, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 131