{"id": "574", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, it is important to take immediate action as they can quickly infest your home. One effective method is to seal off any entry points that mice can use to enter your house, such as pipes and vents. Placing steel wool inside these openings before sealing them can prevent mice from reentering. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources and shelter can help deter mice from your home.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice you need to take immediate action as it is a critical step. Mice can very quickly take up residence and start nesting, so act fast. Consider putting steel wool inside entry points like pipes or vents before sealing them off, as steel wool pads prevent mice from using the hole to get back in and add extra protection if mice are persistent. Also, eliminate food sources and seal tiny openings to prevent access, as rodents consume human-discarded food and fit through the tiniest openings.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice you need to take immediate action as it is a critical step. Mice can very quickly take up residence and start nesting, so act fast. Consider putting steel wool inside entry points like pipes or vents before sealing them off, as steel wool pads prevent mice from using the hole to get back in and add extra protection if mice are persistent. Also, eliminate food sources and seal tiny openings to prevent access, as rodents consume human-discarded food and fit through the tiniest openings.", "time_sec": 14.186, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 10533, 2012, 15515, 1307