{"id": "575", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action by sealing off entry points that mice could use to enter your home. Steel wool is a good material to use for this purpose as it will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, getting rid of rats and mice involves eliminating any sources of food and shelter for these rodents and preventing them from returning.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice you need to take immediate action as it is a critical step. Mice can very quickly take up residence and start nesting, so act fast. Consider putting steel wool inside entry points like pipes or vents before sealing them off, as steel wool pads prevent mice from using the hole to get back in and add extra protection if mice are persistent. Also, eliminate food sources and seal tiny openings to prevent access, as rodents consume human-discarded food and fit through the tiniest openings.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice you need to take immediate action as it is a critical step. Mice can very quickly take up residence and start nesting, so act fast. Consider putting steel wool inside entry points like pipes or vents before sealing them off, as steel wool pads prevent mice from using the hole to get back in and add extra protection if mice are persistent. Also, eliminate food sources and seal tiny openings to prevent access, as rodents consume human-discarded food and fit through the tiniest openings.", "time_sec": 12.473, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 10533, 2012, 15515, 1307, 9425, 1636, 