{"id": "629", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some strategies for guarding a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities (Passage 1).\n2. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is important to stay close to them and create a barrier between them and the basket. These strategies can help limit their shooting opportunities and make it more difficult for them to score.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to the tall player near the three-point line, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near the opponent and minimize shot opportunities, and keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to the tall player near the three-point line, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near the opponent and minimize shot opportunities, and keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "time_sec": 6.524, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 10482, 1261, 18260, 2965, 1294, 36728, 1044, 8855, 1435, 6231, 1435, 4171, 1317, 1278, 18260, 7398, 6117, 1278, 3300, 25185, 3110, 1044, 34898, 25709, 2143, 10509, 1562, 4258, 1317, 4258, 1317, 8855, 6117, 1278, 38135, 1321, 33945, 12800, 20567,