{"id": "637", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, health benefits to jalapenos include pain relief due to capsaicin's pain-killing properties, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, being rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, and supporting cardiovascular health by defending heart health and increasing cardiovascular benefits.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, health benefits to jalapenos include pain relief due to capsaicin's pain-killing properties, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, being rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, and supporting cardiovascular health by defending heart health and increasing cardiovascular benefits.", "time_sec": 8.264, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 4612, 15021, 1317, 67645, 1466, 16365, 4626, 6890, 20081, 3964, 1317, 2735, 7839, 45213, 1681, 6890, 11167, 9184, 7192, 1044, 21892, 1435, 1261, 1942, 5794, 5954, 6410, 11559, 1044, 20544, 1435, 1261, 6967, 45941, 1311, 1590, 8865, 1450, 1044, 18191, 29449, 7008, 6137, 1044, 7008, 6663, 1044