{"id": "655", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with warm water, then use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair (Passage 1, step 6).\n2. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type, and apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand while in the shower (Passage 2, steps 1-3). Work the shampoo through your hair without piling it up on your head, and avoid tangling it while it's still wet.\n3. After applying shampoo, rinse your hair thoroughly with warm water, and then comb through it with your fingers to remove any remaining tangles (Passage 1, step 7).\n4. Apply a conditioner to your hair, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes before rinsing it out with cool water (Passage 1, step 8).\n5. To dry your hair, gently pat it with a towel or wrap it around your head to absorb excess water, avoiding rubbing it vigorously with a towel (Passage 3).\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide instructions on how to style or dry your hair after cleaning it.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, how to properly clean your hair: First, select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Then, ensure the water in the shower is warm but not too hot, and turn the flow down to avoid splashing. Thoroughly wet the hair. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through with fingers if the hair is longer to reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and allow it to remain on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Finally, dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, how to properly clean your hair: First, select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Then, ensure the water in the shower is warm but not too hot, and turn the flow down to avoid splashing. Thoroughly wet the hair. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through with fingers if the hair is longer to reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and allow it to remain on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Finally, dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "time_sec": 16.43, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 2606, 1317, 17103, 9375, 2143, 10188, 1058, 7610, 1044, 5762, 1278, 3875, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1321, 6570, 1258, 1394, 2143, 10188, 2658, 1046, 6830, 1044, 11811, 1278, 4180, 1294, 1278, 37809, 1395, 15701, 1809, 1605, 4382, 8480, 1044, 1321, 3884, 1278, 5692, 3151, 1317, 10035, 15070, 51008, 1046, 27964, 2620, 1405, 18258, 1278, 10188, 1046, 63882, 1261, 52718, 41720, 5647, 1307, 1627, 2372, 12078, 2203, 1278, 36631, 1307, 2143, 2786, 1321, 2196, 1494, 2645, 1278, 10188, 1044, 3830, 1302, 2645, 1454, 17296, 1693, 1278, 10188, 1395, 7934, 1317, 9980, 19953, 2013, 1046, 65117, 1415, 1278, 10188, 10185, 1046, 63882, 6570, 1258, 1294, 1278, 2879, 11665, 1435, 1278, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1321, 3894, 1494, 1317, 10399, 1408, 1394, 1261, 4517, 7334, 1046, 65117, 1415, 1278, 10188, 1454, 12921, 4180, 1321, 3830, 2645, 1494, 2790, 1046, 15513, 1044, 12689, 1278, 10188, 1454, 1261, 74537, 2505, 1261, 2350, 3333, 1505, 69956, 1302, 12968, 