{"id": "656", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with water.\n2. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n3. Apply a conditioner and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n4. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n5. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles.\n\nAdditionally, it is recommended to use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair after washing, and to be gentle when handling wet hair to prevent damage.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, how to properly clean your hair: First, select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Then, ensure the water in the shower is warm but not too hot, and turn the flow down to avoid splashing. Thoroughly wet the hair. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through with fingers if the hair is longer to reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and allow it to remain on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Finally, dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, how to properly clean your hair: First, select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Then, ensure the water in the shower is warm but not too hot, and turn the flow down to avoid splashing. Thoroughly wet the hair. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through with fingers if the hair is longer to reduce tangles. Rinse the hair completely. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and allow it to remain on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Finally, dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing back and forth or in circles to prevent damage.", "time_sec": 21.596, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 2606, 1317, 17103, 9375, 2143, 10188, 1058, 7610, 1044, 5762, 1278, 3875, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1321, 6570, 1258, 1394, 2143, 10188, 2658, 1046, 6830, 1044, 11811, 1278, 4180, 1294, 1278, 37809, 1395, 15701, 1809, 1605, 4382, 8480, 1044, 1321, 3884, 1278, 5692, 3151, 1317, 10035, 15070, 51008, 1046, 27964, 2620, 1405, 18258, 1278, 10188, 1046, 63882, 1261, 52718, 41720, 5647, 1307, 1627, 2372, 12078, 2203, 1278, 36631, 1307, 2143, 2786, 1321, 2196, 1494, 2645, 1278, 10188, 1044, 3830, 1302, 2645, 1454, 17296, 1693, 1278, 10188, 1395, 7934, 1317, 9980, 19953, 2013, 1046, 65117, 1415, 1278, 10188, 10185, 1046, 63882, 6570, 1258, 1294, 1278, 2879, 11665, 1435, 1278, 1627, 2372, 12078, 1321, 3894, 1494, 1317, 10399, 1408, 1394, 1261, 4517, 7334, 1046, 65117, 1415, 1278, 10188, 1454, 12921, 4180, 1321, 3830, 2645, 1494, 2790, 1046, 15513, 1044, 12689, 1278, 10188, 1454, 1261, 74537, 2505, 1261, 2350, 3333, 1505, 69956, 1302, 12968, 1044, 40052, 77487, 2595, 1321, 19888, 1505, 1294, 35438, 1317, 7495, 10605, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [-0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0025, -0.7099, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2196, -0.6997, -0.0154, -0.239, -0.1685, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0128, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0021, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0, -0.4353, -1.0035, -0.0138, -0.2404, -0.3773, -0.0264, -0.5762, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0376, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.0, -0.593, -0.016, -0.0192, -0.0337, -0.0032, -0.0034, -0.1037, -0.0126, -0.0041, -