{"id": "659", "question": "vinegar uses for dogs", "gt": "Vinegar can be used to improve a dog's skin and coat, clean out their ears, repel fleas, and soothe itchy ears.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, vinegar uses for dogs include: mixing 1 cup of vinegar with 2-4 cups of water for a final rinse to rejuvenate the coat and balance skin pH levels; spraying vinegar full-strength on the dog's coat to normalize skin pH balance; using a diluted solution of apple cider vinegar with 50 percent water to soothe itchy ears by applying with a cotton swab or gauze pad; cleaning dog's ears with ACV; spraying the coat to repel fleas; bathing in an ACV-soap mixture to fight fleas; using a flea comb to remove fleas; and rinsing the dog.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, vinegar uses for dogs include: mixing 1 cup of vinegar with 2-4 cups of water for a final rinse to rejuvenate the coat and balance skin pH levels; spraying vinegar full-strength on the dog's coat to normalize skin pH balance; using a diluted solution of apple cider vinegar with 50 percent water to soothe itchy ears by applying with a cotton swab or gauze pad; cleaning dog's ears with ACV; spraying the coat to repel fleas; bathing in an ACV-soap mixture to fight fleas; using a flea comb to remove fleas; and rinsing the dog.", "time_sec": 17.654, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 61359, 8374, 8942, 1394, 25007, 4626, 1058, 26887, 1032, 1049, 19339, 1307, 61359, 8374, 1454, 1032, 1050, 1045, 1052, 60180, 1307, 4180, 1394, 1261, 2778, 38124, 1415, 1317, 1344, 5517, 2154, 1419, 1278, 26100, 1321, 13864, 9877, 1274, 1072, 5283, 1059, 114072, 61359, 8374, 5275, 37086, 2750, 1408, 1278, 10575, 1681, 261