{"id": "681", "question": "how to get free voip service and phone number", "gt": "To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit YouTube channels which provide tutorials on how to access these services, such as the video available at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037. You could also use cloud VoIP services that require no equipment on your end. These services offer toll-free and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number or used with SIP devices for outgoing calls. Additionally, companies offer DID or incoming numbers from around the world either for a flat yearly rate or a monthly fee.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and phone number, visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037 where a video shows how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google, a respected company, and use Cloud VoIP Service which offers free toll-free numbers and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number or used with a SIP device with no equipment required on your end.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and phone number, visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037 where a video shows how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google, a respected company, and use Cloud VoIP Service which offers free toll-free numbers and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number or used with a SIP device with no equipment required on your end.", "time_sec": 13.839, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1317, 2012, 5370, 11962, 9918, 4810, 1321, 9916, 2782, 1044, 9206, 1278, 3213, 21670, 9129, 1513, 6924, 2345, 6132, 63544, 2354