{"id": "706", "question": "what do the colors of the tennessee flag mean", "gt": "The colors on the Tennessee Flag have significant meanings. The white color symbolizes purity, the blue color stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and the red color represents the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare. The three white stars within the blue circle symbolize the three disparate forms of land that divide the state.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the colors of the Tennessee flag have the following meanings: White symbolizes purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare. These colors are the national colors of the US.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the colors of the Tennessee flag have the following meanings: White symbolizes purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare. These colors are the national colors of the US.", "time_sec": 7.253, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 18666, 1307, 1278, 34075, 12585, 1736, 1278, 3629, 52542, 1058, 10330, 9501, 9357, 52210, 1044, 10991, 23737, 1394, 1278, 84320, 2578, 1307, 1278, 3306, 1307, 34075, 1044, 1321, 4804, 23737, 1394, 1278, 91711, 1307, 1278, 3306, 1317, 42878, 6517, 3184, 56184, 1046, 4634, 18666, 1584, 1278, 6168, 18666, 1307, 1278, 3825, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.001, -0.3432, -0.0105, -0.0065, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.3869, -0.4385, -0.4334, -0.0, -0.0065, -0.0034, -0.6332, -0.1626, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.1981, -0.0033, -0.2025, -0.0, -0.0006