{"id": "710", "question": "what do the colors of the tennessee flag mean", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the colors of the Tennessee flag are said to have the following meanings:\n\n* White: Purity\n* Red: Readiness to shed blood during warfare\n* Blue: Patriotism of the people of Tennessee\n\nTherefore, the colors of the Tennessee flag are meant to symbolize the state's patriotism, willingness to defend itself, and purity.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the colors of the Tennessee flag have the following meanings: White symbolizes purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare. These colors are the national colors of the US.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the colors of the Tennessee flag have the following meanings: White symbolizes purity, blue stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and red stands for the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare. These colors are the national colors of the US.", "time_sec": 7.509, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 18666, 1307, 1278, 34075, 12585, 1736, 1278, 3629, 52542, 1058, 10330, 9501, 9357, 52210, 1044, 10991, 23737, 1394, 1278, 84320, 2578, 1307, 1278, 3306, 1307, 34075, 1044, 1321, 4804, 23737, 1394, 1278, 91711, 1307, 1278, 3306, 1317, 42878, 6517, 3184, 56184, 1046, 4634, 18666, 1584, 1278, 6168, 18666, 1307, 1278, 3825, 1046, 11], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.001, -0.3432, -0.0105, -0.0065, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.3869, -0.4385, -0.4334, -0.0, -0.0065, -0.0034, -0.6332, -0.1626, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.1981, -0.0033, -0.2025, -0.0, -0.0006, -0.0, 0.0