{"id": "712", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Passage 2: The exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are a modified tri-set for the chest and a combination of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. To perform the dumbbell exercise: 1 Lay on your back with a dumbbell in each hand. 2 Extend your arms out to your side, as if you were forming a cross. 3 Slowly, with your arms still extended, curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest. 4 Slowly return your arms back to your sides.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are a modified tri-set for the chest and a combination of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. To perform the dumbbell exercise: 1 Lay on your back with a dumbbell in each hand. 2 Extend your arms out to your side, as if you were forming a cross. 3 Slowly, with your arms still extended, curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest. 4 Slowly return your arms back to your sides.", "time_sec": 11.095, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 39693, 1455, 20294, 1278, 15448, 1584, 1261, 13330, 3104, 48511, 1394, 1278, 15448, 1321, 1261, 9943, 1307, 11354, 27988, 1454, 3435, 12203, 10651, 1307, 48313, 4600, 1522, 26808, 81245, 1046, 3870, 3142, 1278, 48313, 4600, 1522, 14587, 1058, 1032, 1049, 57340, 1408, 2143, 2595, 1454, 1261, 48313, 4600, 1522, 1294, 2744, 2786, 1046, 1032, 1050, 13575, 1474, 2143, 11203, 1848, 1317, 2143, 4258, 1044, 1435, 1693, 1636