{"id": "715", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are a modified tri-set for the chest and a combination of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. To perform the dumbbell exercise: 1 Lay on your back with a dumbbell in each hand. 2 Extend your arms out to your side, as if you were forming a cross. 3 Slowly, with your arms still extended, curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest. 4 Slowly return your arms back to your sides.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are a modified tri-set for the chest and a combination of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. To perform the dumbbell exercise: 1 Lay on your back with a dumbbell in each hand. 2 Extend your arms out to your side, as if you were forming a cross. 3 Slowly, with your arms still extended, curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest. 4 Slowly return your arms back to your sides.", "time_sec": 14.768, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 39693, 1455, 20294, 1278, 15448, 1584, 1261, 13330, 3104, 48511, 1394, 1278, 15448, 1321, 1261, 9943, 1307, 11354, 27988, 1454, 3435, 12203, 10651, 1307, 48313, 4600, 1522, 26808, 81245, 1046, 3870,