{"id": "716", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, the following exercises are mentioned as toning the chest:\n\n* Modified tri-set for the chest (not specified)\n* Pushups\n* Dumbbell bench presses\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What exercises tone the chest?\" based on the given passages is:\n\nModified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are a modified tri-set for the chest and a combination of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. To perform the dumbbell exercise: 1 Lay on your back with a dumbbell in each hand. 2 Extend your arms out to your side, as if you were forming a cross. 3 Slowly, with your arms still extended, curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest. 4 Slowly return your arms back to your sides.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are a modified tri-set for the chest and a combination of pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. To perform the dumbbell exercise: 1 Lay on your back with a dumbbell in each hand. 2 Extend your arms out to your side, as if you were forming a cross. 3 Slowly, with your arms still extended, curl your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest. 4 Slowly return your arms back to your sides.", "time_sec": 17.167, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 1278, 39693, 1455, 20294, 1278, 15448, 1584, 1261, 13330, 3104, 48511, 1394, 1278, 15448, 1321, 1261, 9943, 1307, 11354, 27988, 1454, 3435, 12203, 10651, 1307, 48313, 4600, 1522, 26808