{"id": "736", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "The difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text-only messages of up to 160 characters, while MMS allows you to send messages with pictures, sounds, videos, and text, with a larger content size of up to 300KB.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, SMS only allows sending text messages, while MMS allows sending pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of these four types of content. SMS messages are limited to 160 characters and are split into multiple parts if longer, whereas MMS messages can carry larger content sizes up to 300KB and support multimedia formats like WAV, JPEG, and GIF. SMS is a text-only service, whereas MMS is an evolution of SMS that supports multimedia content.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_nemotron", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, SMS only allows sending text messages, while MMS allows sending pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of these four types of content. SMS messages are limited to 160 characters and are split into multiple parts if longer, whereas MMS messages can carry larger content sizes up to 300KB and support multimedia formats like WAV, JPEG, and GIF. SMS is a text-only service, whereas MMS is an evolution of SMS that supports multimedia content.", "time_sec": 15.522, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-5.6.2-trust-remote-code", "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1010, 35957, 1408, 1278, 4265, 42679, 1044, 54030, 2342, 9985, 20234, 3403, 14193, 1044, 3016, 1373, 7985, 9985, 20234, 23874, 1044, 18267, 1044, 26612, 1044, 3403, 1044, 1505, 2258, 9943, 1307, 2576, 3946, 6413, 1307, 4701, 1046, 54030, 14193, 1584, 8031, 1317, 1032, 1049, 1054, 1048, 11084, 1321, 1584, 13156, 2203, 6245, 8262, 1693, 7934, 1044, 11275, 1373, 7985, 14193, 1710,